title: >-
  PAG ETR · framework reprodutível de analogia geológica para priorização
  de investigação geoquímica de elementos terras raras em Mato Grosso do Sul
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Busón Buesa
    given-names: Carlos
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1446-2252
    affiliation: Universidade Federal de Mato Grosso do Sul, PPGTA, FAENG
  - family-names: Gabas
    given-names: Sandra Garcia
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1027-0288
    affiliation: Universidade Federal de Mato Grosso do Sul, PPGTA, FAENG
repository-code: https://github.com/cbuson/pag-etr-ms
url: https://cbuson.github.io/pag-etr-ms/
abstract: >-
  PAG ETR is a logical, categorical, multiscale and reproducible framework
  for diagnosing evaluability and organizing rare-earth-element geochemical
  investigation hypotheses in territories with incomplete geoscientific data.
  The first pilot implementation in Mato Grosso do Sul preserves explicit
  unknown states, non-compensatory rules, provenance, independent 250, 500
  and 1000 km² grids, frozen results, reproduction scripts, tests and a public
  cartographic interface. The reproducible package was extracted from
  ITA ARANDU MS to permit independent auditing of the pilot. PAG ETR does not
  identify deposits, resources or reserves and does not constitute field
  authorization.
keywords:
  - rare earth elements
  - elementos terras raras
  - mineral prospectivity
  - mineral systems
  - analogia geológica
  - dados incompletos
  - lógica não compensatória
  - reprodutibilidade
  - geociências
  - Mato Grosso do Sul
references:
